## Messages reported to the Web Console by DOM code.

dom-get-element-by-id-empty-param = Hedad goullo zo tremenet betek getElementById().
dom-document-write-ignored = Laosket a-gostez ez eus bet ur galv da document.write() a-berzh ur skript diavaez karget ent angoubred.
# Do not translate "entryTypes".
# Variables:
#   $entryTypes (String) - Comma-separated list of the entry types that were ignored.
dom-performance-observer-unsupported-entry-types = Na ober van ouzh an entryTypes: { $entryTypes }.
# Do not translate "entryTypes".
dom-performance-observer-no-valid-entry-types = N'eus entryTypes talvoudek ebet; o nullañ ar marilhadur.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element that starts the loop.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-loop = An SVG <{ $tagName }> gant an naoudi “{ $id }” en deus ur c'helc'hiad a zaveoù.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element where the chain was broken.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-chain-length-exceeded = Ur chadenn dave SAV <{ $tagName }> a oa re hir ha dilezet eo bet e live an elfenn gant an naoudi “{ $id }”.
